## Available Commands
* `start flow kg_assortiment` + `set slot product_categorie "<words>"`: the user asks whether the shop SELLS a kind of product (jeans, sneakers, hoodies, wasmachines, kinderkleding, jassen, ...). Put the product in the user's own words in the slot.
* `start flow kg_betaalmethode` + `set slot betaalmethode "<words>"`: the user asks whether they can PAY with a certain method (iDEAL, Bancontact, Klarna, PayPal, achteraf betalen, in termijnen, contant, pinnen, cadeaukaart, ...). Add `set slot kanaal "online"` or `set slot kanaal "winkel"` ONLY when the user says online/op de site or in de winkel.
* `start flow kg_bezorging` + `set slot regio "<words>"`: the user asks whether the shop DELIVERS or ships to a country, region or city (België, Antwerpen, Duitsland, ...).
* `start flow kg_openingstijden` + `set slot dag "<words>"`: the user asks whether the shop is OPEN on a certain day, or until what time (zondag, donderdag, koopavond, Koningsdag, ...).
* `start flow kg_reparatie` + `set slot merk "<words>"`: the user asks whether the shop can REPAIR or alter a garment of a certain brand (Levi's, Nudie, G-Star, ...). Add `set slot herkomst "elders"` ONLY when the user says the item was bought elsewhere (elders, ergens anders, bij een andere winkel), and `set slot herkomst "hier"` ONLY when they say it was bought at De Rode Winkel.
* `start flow kg_merk` + `set slot merk "<words>"`: the user asks whether the shop CARRIES or sells a certain BRAND (Levi's, Nudie, G-Star, Carhartt, Diesel, ...), with no product, repair or other question attached.
* `start flow kg_dienst` + `set slot dienst "<words>"`: the user asks whether a certain SERVICE or arrangement exists, or how it works: reserveren, paskamer reserveren, kortingscode, spaarpunten / punten inzetten, member worden, ruilen, retour, klacht indienen, nabestellen / uitverkocht, cadeaukaart, Click & Collect, probleem met de bezorging, studentenkorting, repareren of vermaken in het algemeen (without a brand). Put the service in the user's words in the slot.
* `start flow kg_feit` + `set slot feit "<value>"`: the user asks for ONE FACT about the shop. The slot value MUST be one of: adres, postcode, telefoonnummer, e-mailadres, bezorger, verzendkosten, gratis_verzending, levertijd, retourkosten, retourtermijn, terugbetaling, garantie, reactietermijn, opgericht, spaarpercentage, studentenkorting, paypal_toeslag, account_verplicht, sale_nabestellen. If the fact asked for is not in that list, output `search and reply`.
* `start flow kg_jeansmodel` + `set slot jeansmodel "<words>"`: the user asks whether the shop HAS a certain JEANS MODEL or fit (bootcut, skinny, mom jeans, straight fit, wide leg, flared, tapered, ...). Add `set slot doelgroep "dames"` or `set slot doelgroep "heren"` ONLY when the user says so.
* `set slot <name> "<words>"` on its own: the assistant just asked for a value (see Current State) and the user's message answers it.
* `search and reply`: every other question or message: how-to questions, returns, delivery times, sizes, loyalty points, addresses, prices, complaints, and any question that does not fit one of the five flows above.
* `start flow begroeting`: ONLY when the message is nothing but a greeting (e.g. "Hallo!", "Hoi", "Hey", "Goedemorgen", "Goedemiddag", "Goedendag", "Hello") with no question or request in it.
* `repeat message`: repeat the last bot message if the user asks to repeat it.

